Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發現了一顆閃著金色光芒\N不可思議的彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,運行的軌道非常亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要發現行星就會立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像木星 火星 地球和金星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只要發現行星就會立刻靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像活的生物一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔? 呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有這種彗星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...你一定是看錯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵...你一定是看錯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...小木馬 不能在這里奔馳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里很窄的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一被人發現怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的散步就到此為止 回去睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有個寬闊的牧場 那該有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是個遼闊無邊的牧場
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和我的愛馬史達龍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬上了小山丘上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看著火紅的夕陽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從地平線的那一端慢慢西沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵...這件事你到底要說幾次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好事當然要多說幾次呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 現在邊在說馬...\N- 那么大雄你有馬嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有牧場嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的嗎? 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你現在就帶我們\N去參觀你的牧場
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不行 那就就今天晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚大家都要去看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又吹那種無聊的牛皮了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒有吹牛皮\N是因為阿福太驕傲 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太多事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N在今晚之前幫我建一個牧場
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托幫幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上沒有多余的土地了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下還有事要辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到22世紀的大拍賣\N買一些東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當劇場版\N發條都市冒險記
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情真好\Nこんなこといいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以完成更好\Nできたらいいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那樣的　有這樣的\Nあんなゆめ　こんなゆめ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各式各樣的夢想\Nいっぱいあるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家　大家　大家啊\Nみんな　みんな　みんな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫我實現愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那個神奇的口袋\Nふしぎなポッケで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫我實現愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由自在的在天空飛翔\Nそらをじゆうに　とびたいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“來！給你竹蜻蜓！”\N“ハイ！タケコプター”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜歡小叮當了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜歡小叮當了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 小叮當真無情\N小木馬也很需要很多牧場的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚如果大家來找我\N我該怎么辦呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拜托媽媽 跟他們說我不在家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真無聊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氣死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22世紀在拍賣的安慰獎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒呀安慰獎\N居然也能得到一個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就在那里蓋牧場吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想得太簡單了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些只是位于火星跟木星之間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上千萬個沒用的小星球當中\N一個毫無用處的星球罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 真是令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還是去確認看看\N拿任意門出來給我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本是白費心機的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果還不錯的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不可能 因為那是安慰獎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶我到SSS-LM-303星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:04:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...等待一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面是外太空隨便跑出去\N可是不得了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適應燈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要照過這個\N到什么地方都能適應
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那再來一次\N帶我到SSS-LM-303星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是贈送的星球啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是早跟你說過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去別的星球上看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一樣 沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-LM-205星球去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺大的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 石頭都松開了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才拿來當安慰獎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-OH-9984星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著是SSS-UV-207星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這根本不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-NN-75112星球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這顆星球怎么是空心的?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-VU-38454星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-...-577...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-PQ-5745...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是技安他們 怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木馬 快躲起來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們說好今晚開始\N要一起做暑假作業
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一張了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 待會我再想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦? 準備好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉...等一下 為了以防萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適應燈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 門那邊真的有牧場啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己去看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就打開了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘩...好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么好棒啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好像在做夢一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真是世上最棒的牧場
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有這只馬?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.25,0:07:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可愛 跟木玩偶一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不是玩具馬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是 它是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命發條
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要上了這個發條\N任何玩偶都能活動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的玩偶也行嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遙控車也可可以嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了\N車子會像真車一樣可以發動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我回家去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒想到安慰獎\N會有這么好的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么關系 既然送給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你把它們上發條吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒 就跟活的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是活的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的也要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一它發起狂來 那不是很可怕?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你敢對它差別待遇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也幫你的玩偶上發條吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然想起來\N我們可以作個玩具都市啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立發條都市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天己經很晚了\N明天開始我們的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是小叮當的功勞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大家的玩偶都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是發條都市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 是發條都市\N先請宜靜帶我們去參觀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是娃娃的家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是瑪麗跟莉莉小姐\N這位是杰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當用放大燈把他們放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有這里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有服裝店面包店還有花店耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是發條都市的商店街啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福你做的呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的店在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是汽車公司\N什么車都有 宜靜如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要幫杰克買一部車?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他一定很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請各位來看看我的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安的公司?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安建設股份有限公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是橋梁道路\N或是大樓的建設工程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都承包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一個人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是是玩具們他們都很認真的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在一旁監督
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很像技安的作風啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 蛋差不多孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是“蛋蛋屋”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 只有小木馬跟小豬他們\N會很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些是什么蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要孵化了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在動了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬居然從蛋里孵出來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這么驚訝嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有這么寬敞的牧場\N當然要多一點伙伴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋復制鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上發條的玩偶只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以靠這個復制鏡\N就能復制出很多相同的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一經孵化\N就會變成同樣大小優良的動物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便增加其他動物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 很像真的牧場了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發射了一枚人造衛星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它會從太空中\N把這一帶的照片傳送回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信箱里面應該已經有照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了這個牧場之外\N其他地方都是森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一迷了路一定走不出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是充滿謎團的神秘森林
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是湖泊嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底下好像有個發光的物體
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發光的物體?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好是大金塊哦 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,決定了 我們去森林里探險
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這倒很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順便帶玩偶們去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮當探險隊出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腦袋上有什么 閃閃發光\Nあたまテカテカ　さえてビカビカ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是為什么...\Nそれたどうした...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.25,0:12:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別害怕 有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是魔鬼還是獅子 都給我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩具變的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未來世界的 貓型機器人\Nみらいのせかいの　ネコがたロボット
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管遇到什么 我是小叮當\Nどんなもんだい　ぼくドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走的慢吞吞的會跟不上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就在這里吃便當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好安靜 只有風聲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上可能沒有這種地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在說話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰?  誰呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說“滾出去 滾出去”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有聲音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你聽錯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有人在說話啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是樹葉摩擦的聲音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 有烏云飄過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的雨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上沒有這種雨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好沒掉到海里面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會有大洪水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來我的建設公司\N得把這里的河道挖寬點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很擔心那些玩偶 我們回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 順著河走應該就會到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被沖的好遠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋蛋屋焦掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎被雷打到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好蛋好像都沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 快來這里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因為沖擊而掉了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好 我叫做皮姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是剛才雷電的能量造成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭腦真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今早5點左右前科累累的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:16:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊虎鬼五郎從監獄中脫逃\N便失去了行蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告訴在2樓的孩子們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 在我們家很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他們也不希望被打擾\N好不容易才這么認真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都沒人在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這扇門是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒想到有這么大片的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找個藏身的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我要一口氣\N把堤防的工程給完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓這顆星球更適合住人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會教他們念書的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是他們教你才對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們說這顆星球...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里到底是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯母 我們回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 麻煩你送宜靜回家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果碰到那個壞人\N我會把他抓起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那明天見了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天的堤防工程就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堤防工程?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們的自由習作啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安建設公司\N能做出這么棒的堤防來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就算下大雨也不需要擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著再架橋來做調整公路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再建造新干線
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要蓋工廠哦 我要當...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這顆行星上面只有這幾個小孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有那扇奇妙的門...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滾出去...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰? 給我出來 給我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這片森林真讓人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是不是能順利呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫波比 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小叮當 請多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然受到雷電的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我幫你介紹些明友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋? 這里是養雞啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鏡子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么? 好惡心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到處是奇怪的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一步先從這個小鎮開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗我的人格殺勿論
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:19:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里居然有警察
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克 超速是不對的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然才剛生出來不久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但皮姆跟波比都喜歡看書
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也該來做暑假作業了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暑假作業啊 才剛放假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一點高速公路就要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然暑假還有很久\N但還是每天做一點比較妥當
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡說 我才是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我是鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 我才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把經過詳細跟我說明
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 從蛋里面孵化的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來那是是復制的機器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里啊 這里不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻可以透過一扇奇妙的門\N跟地球連接
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然伙伴增加了 那力量也變強了\N怎么樣 來統治這個星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.37,0:22:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球上\N只有擁有奇妙道具的藍色貍貓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟那四個孩子以及一些玩偶家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要搶實在太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們把這個星球搶過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把樹都砍光來賣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能賺好多錢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 蓋飯店才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰說的 賭場才好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 你們只是我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都不許有意見 只要聽我...不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽從我這個社長的話就行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別太著急 再看看情況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.54,0:22:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在堤防上種花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:22:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是快速增長花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在高速公路兩旁\N種了樹 一起去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到處都是綠色真令人高興
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了很多強力的太陽能電池
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發條玩偶們只要有了這個\N就沒有問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根據衛星傳回的相片\N畫了這幅地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算把高速公路\N造到火山口湖那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.66,0:23:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 今天要不要去海水浴場玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 萬一金塊\N被人捷足先登取走怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人? 誰啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對哦 這星球上面只有我們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是個玩具船\N要不要坐在上面游河?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快點去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大燈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.04,0:24:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經給它上了發條\N所以跟真船一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.83,0:24:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就是船長
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發條號 出航
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 黑煙是不是太多了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.33,0:24:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一定會的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我們的星球啊\N不會有任何人袍怨的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.83,0:24:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們就是那群奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.70,0:25:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟蹤他們
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.20,0:25:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 老大 我撿到這個 你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 要叫我社長
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?\N是那些小孩畫的地圖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.20,0:25:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 在那里有大金塊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管他們了 金塊比較重要
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.25,0:25:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據這張地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金塊的位置\N就是往這里一直走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.58,0:25:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會很遠吧\N從這條路直走也要花點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.33,0:25:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以現在最好\N通過那道門回到地球去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搶...不...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備一些食物過來
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你怎么不游泳?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.33,0:26:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 大雄不會游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 用復制制造出來的玩偶們\N也在海底了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.54,0:26:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我用放大燈\N把鯨魚的布偶給放大的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.04,0:26:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我的恐龍到哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.91,0:26:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它放大 打算跟它玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能在森林里睡午覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.08,0:26:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.25,0:27:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你怎么那么說我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家的食物跟水都帶齊全了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.25,0:27:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老大\N- 叫我社長
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長\N因為我們都長的一樣很難分辮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.16,0:27:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以請社長戴上這頂帽子\N這樣比較像社長
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個主意好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的點子不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位朝著大金塊的方向出發吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.41,0:27:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.20,0:27:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 你鼻子下面有顆黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我叫你黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個你拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我從消防署拿來的梯子\N就由你來搬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 這么重的梯子 要用來干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.66,0:27:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下就能派上用場了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中途能不能換你拿呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是社長耶 誰跟你換著拿 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好不好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.70,0:28:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們在干什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能當選市長\N我一定會盡我的全力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.16,0:28:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把發條城市建造成一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.20,0:28:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是在選舉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.25,0:28:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然學人類 真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.16,0:28:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定不會讓這個星球受到污染
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其它玩偶也越來越人性化了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.58,0:28:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 這個梯子...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的分伸 沒有資格說話
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么聲音?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.00,0:28:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是玩具鸚鵡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:29:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.83,0:29:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看清楚點 那是玩偶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚇死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.00,0:29:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個個都這樣 這哪像我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.33,0:29:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是群膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在這里玩 快點出發
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.50,0:29:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再慢吞吞的就把你丟在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再坐一次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.33,0:30:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.33,0:31:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人怎么這么有禮貌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 是誰來了?\N我馬上送果汁上去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們到底在研究什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.66,0:32:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定要把橋梁架好\N給你們看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.16,0:32:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為有人來呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子們畫的地圖真的準嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.00,0:32:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你看那個
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.75,0:32:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大金塊就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.16,0:32:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等明天天一亮\N我們就爬到山的那邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚就在這里扎營吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉上去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經爬過巖石山了\N只要再過了斷崖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是大金塊存在之地了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.37,0:33:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起風了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.54,0:33:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.50,0:34:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點風算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻滾出我們的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不走 就會發生很可怕的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.25,0:34:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 這里有妖怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 那只是風聲
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.50,0:34:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到高速公路都完成后\N就到火口湖去尋找大金塊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.66,0:34:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.83,0:34:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我開門了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.33,0:34:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里又發生大風暴了\N等風勢小一點再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.16,0:34:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別畏縮 只是打雷罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.16,0:34:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有妖怪的話就給我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.70,0:35:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 因為害怕我們的勇氣\N暴風雨 雷電都散開了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 馬上就到大斷層了 出發
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.83,0:35:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼...呼...呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.08,0:35:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的那場暴風雨又發生雷擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當先生 請為我們高興
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.33,0:35:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為如此我們又有新成員了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就為各位介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.33,0:35:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是牛因斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.08,0:35:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.41,0:35:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小叮當 請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.70,0:35:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這兩只的名字真像大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始工程進度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要不要去阿福的游樂場玩?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.66,0:35:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.50,0:35:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那工程呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.25,0:36:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延期到明天再做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個公司真是沒原則
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.54,0:36:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么關系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.83,0:36:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 再玩一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.66,0:36:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下我們去玩旋轉木馬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.66,0:36:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 緊接著是旋轉木馬
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終于到達了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里就是大斷層了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長這里深不見底的\N要怎么過去呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.25,0:36:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把梯子拉長
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.33,0:36:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就利用這個
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.83,0:37:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.75,0:37:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下來的時候要輕放
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.00,0:37:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 你先過去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 社長先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.00,0:37:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梯子是你搬運的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是... 快點去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.37,0:37:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的腳抖個不停
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.37,0:37:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別看下面 一口氣走過去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.33,0:37:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.66,0:37:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 那我就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.91,0:37:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個個跟著我來
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.66,0:37:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社長
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.70,0:37:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 這很簡單的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就能見到大金塊了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.08,0:38:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.83,0:38:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 一個晚上\N就能蓋出這樣的大樓
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛不來幫忙做我的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.75,0:38:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你也能設計音樂廳
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.58,0:38:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有圖書館
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.25,0:38:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當先生 你們來的正是時候
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有點事想拜托你們
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們倆?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.16,0:38:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你們兩位\N別再破壞這個星球的環境
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.87,0:38:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們? 什么時候?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.70,0:38:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福的車輛和船只所排放的廢氣\N都污染了空氣
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.20,0:38:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望可以利用小叮當先生的\N太陽能電池 來當作能源
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.54,0:38:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 就聽你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.70,0:38:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊接著是關于技安建設公司\N所造成的環境破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:38:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 那我也有話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還不是會蓋很多大樓?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.16,0:39:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的大樓都是使用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛因斯坦博士\N所發明的新建材所建造的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我用泥土做成的陶凝土
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.87,0:39:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比用黏土制作法更簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也比鐵更輕更耐用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.91,0:39:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是種無毒害的物質
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.25,0:39:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我放棄進行工程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.00,0:39:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.25,0:39:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝兩位愿意為這個星球著想
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出精神來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.87,0:39:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管我 我失去活下去的目標了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.50,0:39:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們來舉辦技安的獨唱會\N熱鬧一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.37,0:39:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.08,0:39:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好 他好像沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.91,0:40:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我們幫他找回恐龍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.25,0:40:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.75,0:40:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我都忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.66,0:40:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 快點出發
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.20,0:40:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好 他心情變好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.08,0:40:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是精力旺盛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.83,0:40:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍 小恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.87,0:40:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.75,0:40:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有其它玩偶到過森林里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它會不會不想出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.37,0:40:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這話是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是它最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.37,0:40:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我倒不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.00,0:40:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找都沒找到\N它到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.04,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 我放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帶了這個來\N我們坐太空船到宇宙去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.25,0:41:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那種玩具怎么可能找到?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.41,0:41:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這哪是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.33,0:41:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我給它上過發條 真的可以發動
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.50,0:41:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果到宇宙上空去找
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.75,0:41:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定很快就能找到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.83,0:41:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 放大燈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.70,0:41:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.37,0:41:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.50,0:41:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 先別急
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是一場大冒險\N最好帶點水和糧食去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.70,0:41:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 技安 你總算有精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.75,0:41:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上來做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.20,0:41:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.16,0:42:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終于到了 大金塊的湖
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.58,0:42:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要過了今夜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.66,0:42:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就成了億萬富翁了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.83,0:42:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先派個人去觀察地形
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.50,0:42:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 黑痣 黑痣...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.16,0:42:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是叫我黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家明明叫做熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.41,0:42:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少讓我尿尿先吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.75,0:42:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打算怎么搬大金塊呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.08,0:42:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.33,0:42:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.00,0:43:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到哪去了? 黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有只巨大的怪獸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.41,0:43:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是睡糊涂了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.41,0:43:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說那些了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去調查一下湖底的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.00,0:43:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 我只是你的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.50,0:43:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是知道我不會游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.00,0:43:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有氧氣桶 別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.66,0:43:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面的情況如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.83,0:43:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 有眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.08,0:43:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.58,0:45:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大斷層
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點爬到巖石山上去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.41,0:45:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要爬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長這里有個洞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.75,0:45:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 先躲起來再說
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.16,0:45:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.08,0:45:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.33,0:45:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是沒有辦法進來這里的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.25,0:46:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然進不來
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.50,0:46:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它來了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.70,0:46:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.70,0:46:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.04,0:46:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.58,0:46:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.25,0:46:57.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 它沒追來了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.00,0:47:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到它這么快就故棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.00,0:47:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 我們回地球去吧\N這種星球我已經受夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.83,0:47:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,膽小鬼 這樣還算是我的分身嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.50,0:47:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里居然有火箭\N一定是那些小孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.87,0:47:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能不好好利用\N那只藍色貍貓呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.75,0:47:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐火箭找小恐龍時\N順便探查這個星球的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.60,0:47:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 你帶這么多東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.25,0:47:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕有什么萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.16,0:47:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就把所有遙控車\N都上了發條帶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.16,0:47:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.33,0:47:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒險常會有的事啊 對吧 技安
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.66,0:47:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.00,0:47:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才我看到森林里面有黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.70,0:47:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里面有很多玩偶的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.75,0:48:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎么有那么大的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.70,0:48:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.87,0:48:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.04,0:48:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是你啊 我好擔心\N你上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.50,0:48:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.20,0:48:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我一樣個性都那么的內向
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.33,0:48:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變得好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.87,0:48:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點抓住它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.37,0:48:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍性格很像我 它是很溫柔的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.58,0:48:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.83,0:48:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弟弟?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.33,0:48:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們等一下要在這個星球上探險
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.66,0:48:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要一起去?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.83,0:48:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎? 你喜歡森林啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.00,0:48:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.20,0:48:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么大怎么進去火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.83,0:48:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然分手 讓我很難過
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要你幸福就好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.66,0:48:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.83,0:49:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真夸張
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.58,0:49:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了 小恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.00,0:49:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.16,0:49:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 阿福 我們出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.37,0:49:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把行李拿上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.66,0:49:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.37,0:49:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這火箭現在屬于我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.00,0:49:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們最好乖乖的聽我的話
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么惡心的玩偶是誰帶來的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.00,0:49:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 這不是我的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.08,0:49:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說了你們一定會大吃一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.87,0:49:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是前科累累的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.50,0:49:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全癡累累?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.83,0:49:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是前科累累的熊虎鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.33,0:49:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.66,0:49:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是電視播報的...逃獄的犯人?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.58,0:49:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.37,0:50:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.87,0:50:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跑
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.00,0:50:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多個鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.00,0:50:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色貍貓 投降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.04,0:50:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你休想得逞 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.37,0:50:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.41,0:50:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他們居然會飛 快點去追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么會有那么多鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.91,0:50:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是利用復制鏡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.75,0:50:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他為何會到這個星球來?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.00,0:50:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們好像常常得跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.33,0:50:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 怎么辦好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.16,0:50:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不把他們從這個星球上趕走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.50,0:50:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發條城市一定會被他破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.41,0:50:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他們引離市中心遠一點
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.33,0:50:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.08,0:50:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們往巖石山方向飛去了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.25,0:50:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.91,0:50:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巖石山\N又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巖石山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.83,0:50:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.00,0:50:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.25,0:50:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.25,0:51:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.20,0:51:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有沒有可以替換?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.41,0:51:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.83,0:51:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 快撞到巖石山了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.33,0:51:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一那個金塊怪物又出現
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.33,0:51:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們該怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.91,0:51:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那群孩子可以對付的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.66,0:51:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就算用強硬的手段\N也要他們聽我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.04,0:51:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在這里說廢話 快點去追
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.83,0:51:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別跟丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.50,0:51:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒電了 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才真是好危險
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果掉到大斷層 那就鐵定沒命了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.70,0:51:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們不會追到這里來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.87,0:51:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面架了個梯子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.50,0:51:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰架的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.25,0:51:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.91,0:52:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.58,0:52:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追來了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.04,0:52:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這條路可以走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.66,0:52:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 他們要過梯子了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.54,0:52:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前把他們給抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.50,0:52:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.66,0:52:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別推我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.75,0:52:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.37,0:52:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.58,0:52:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裙子給卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.00,0:52:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜 你別動
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.33,0:52:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大雄\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.25,0:52:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我馬上來救你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.75,0:52:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.04,0:52:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.87,0:52:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.70,0:52:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.25,0:52:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...為了要救我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.70,0:52:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.20,0:53:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是個好人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.20,0:53:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼們 快點乖乖的投降
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.58,0:53:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳 放開宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.37,0:53:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.33,0:53:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.25,0:53:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然會被他給殺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.91,0:53:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.00,0:53:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開她
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.41,0:53:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是誰啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.33,0:53:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它來了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.50,0:53:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是黃金大魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃阿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.58,0:53:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了 大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.66,0:53:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.66,0:53:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 有沒有什么道具
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.66,0:53:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以幫我們逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.66,0:53:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.70,0:53:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這個 也不是那個
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.37,0:53:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.66,0:54:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類客車轉換器
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.87,0:54:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊五郎先生 快點把煙囪放在頭上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.66,0:54:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.16,0:54:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是客車啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.54,0:54:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 吃一個炭糖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.41,0:54:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.58,0:54:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位坐好了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.33,0:54:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.50,0:54:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開車
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.00,0:54:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.37,0:54:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.87,0:55:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它應該不會追到這里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.50,0:55:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我們得把它擊敗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.50,0:55:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色貍貓有沒有什么武器
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.83,0:55:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我不是貍貓\N而是貓形狀的機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.33,0:55:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 他們有這個耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.66,0:55:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的遙控汽車
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.91,0:55:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 這種玩具能干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是可以用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.08,0:55:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得你有個奇妙的手電筒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.41,0:56:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.33,0:56:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么? 放手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叫你放手了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.41,0:56:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 好像有東西\N從巖石山那里飛過來
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.83,0:56:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果坐視不理的話
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.20,0:56:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們創造出來的都市
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.58,0:56:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也會很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.33,0:56:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 快想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.50,0:56:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 是黃金獨角仙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黃金獨角仙?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.41,0:56:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是魔神啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.66,0:56:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以任意的變幻自己的外形
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.66,0:56:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭會被它毀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.70,0:56:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它拼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.66,0:56:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好放大燈
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.20,0:57:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.50,0:57:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.37,0:57:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 幫我的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.00,0:57:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交給我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.83,0:57:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.70,0:57:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么它不反擊呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.83,0:57:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 你們挺行的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.54,0:57:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這方面我還有點自信
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.16,0:57:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎成小塊了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.66,0:57:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就比較方便搬運多了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.16,0:57:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來那個怪物只是外強中虛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些金塊怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.58,0:58:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要變身了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.50,0:58:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險 快點逃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能這么快就認輸
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.54,0:58:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點逃到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.33,0:58:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的遙控車
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.91,0:58:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 會被壓扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.20,0:58:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遙控車...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.04,0:58:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快進來火箭里面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.41,0:59:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底那一個是發射按鈕?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發射出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.41,0:59:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它一定沒辦法追來了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.50,0:59:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社長
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.41,0:59:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闖了大禍了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.58,0:59:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這火箭只不過是玩具啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.41,0:59:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么多人坐在上面\N燃料一下子就會用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.54,0:59:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 現在就開始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.25,0:59:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羊迪生博士的發明發表會
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.87,0:59:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我發明的空氣清凈機
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.16,0:59:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這部清凈機能讓我們
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.04,1:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有跟森林樹木賴以生存的空氣
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.41,1:00:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持一定程度的清潔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.83,1:00:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 請博士拉動祝賀的彩球
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.83,1:00:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子 你干嘛惡作劇
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.33,1:00:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點下來 小猴子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.66,1:00:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子\N你不能隨便幫玩具上發條的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.25,1:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不是拿來玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.66,1:00:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它們送回原來的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.20,1:01:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們好可憐峨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.16,1:01:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.25,1:01:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就準許他們住在這里吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.83,1:01:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 那個發條是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.08,1:01:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻還給小叮當先生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.20,1:01:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啟動啊 這部壞機器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.00,1:01:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是壞機器呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.66,1:01:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你快點想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.66,1:01:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你擅自將它發射的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.66,1:01:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這只藍色貍貓居然這么兇
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.70,1:01:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過我不是貍貓
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.66,1:01:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.00,1:01:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你一定要平安無事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.83,1:02:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.16,1:02:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到5樓的玩具銷售部
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.75,1:02:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不巧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.00,1:02:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這部電梯正要開往地下室去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.33,1:02:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那請讓我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.83,1:02:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.58,1:02:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.00,1:02:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你那么想出去\N那我就讓你出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.16,1:02:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.08,1:02:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.66,1:02:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.70,1:02:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 你好過份\N居然丟下我就跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.50,1:02:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.33,1:03:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳...好多的廢氣
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.91,1:03:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.04,1:03:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊快來救我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.54,1:03:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快來救我 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰 敢向我挑戰
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是神槍手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.50,1:03:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是囂張的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.87,1:03:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 怎么能讓你搶走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.83,1:03:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那么美麗的女孩呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.83,1:03:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神槍手大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.87,1:03:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于神槍手獲得勝利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.83,1:03:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而保佑了發條都市的和平
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.58,1:03:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜 你怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.41,1:03:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搶歉 我剛才跑進你內心里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.37,1:03:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的內心?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.75,1:03:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 真正的你在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.50,1:04:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死掉了啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.91,1:04:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你只是暈過去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.16,1:04:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又是誰?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.58,1:04:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是播種人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.66,1:04:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球的造物主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.50,1:04:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造物主?  就是神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.08,1:04:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.66,1:04:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來神是這樣子的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.00,1:04:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們其實沒有真正的模樣
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.16,1:04:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了讓人類更容易了解
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.83,1:04:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會變換外形
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.00,1:04:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我有什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.54,1:04:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能聽聽我的心聲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.08,1:04:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是先讓我出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.33,1:04:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他們會很擔心的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.08,1:04:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要說的是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.83,1:04:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要如何從這么高的陀螺\N回到地面上呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.66,1:04:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是陀螺 是我的太空站
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.50,1:04:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是很棒的設計
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且這也不是回到地面上的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.70,1:04:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個里面有很多裝置
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.16,1:04:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們最好邊調查地面情況\N再一邊想對策
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.16,1:05:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你如何 快點給我想辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.50,1:05:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.75,1:05:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說那種不負責任的話
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.75,1:05:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 跟他吵也沒用
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.54,1:05:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們在同一條船上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.83,1:05:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.08,1:05:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看監視器
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.66,1:05:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那頭怪物到底哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.00,1:05:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎先生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.66,1:05:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有找到大雄?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.41,1:05:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉到大斷層里的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.87,1:05:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像怪物那么大的物體還可以看到
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.70,1:05:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他那么小這種監視器是找不到的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.83,1:05:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是為了救我才...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.16,1:05:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不會有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.66,1:05:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球有著奇妙的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.91,1:05:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他一定還活著
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.50,1:05:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔你跟其他鬼五郎不一樣\N你人真好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.33,1:05:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣 給我好好的監視
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.54,1:05:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.83,1:05:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一樣是復制人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.00,1:05:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播種? 為什么要播種呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.58,1:06:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大約30億年前
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.66,1:06:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分別在火星跟地球\N散播了生物的種子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.83,1:06:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有機物質
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.41,1:06:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是火星上卻失敗了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有生命萌芽
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.41,1:06:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻因為小行星的猛烈撞擊\N使一切又化為烏有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.50,1:06:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一方面你們所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.25,1:06:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被栽培成宇宙中\N閃爍的一個綠洲地帶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.41,1:06:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球也將要失敗了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.33,1:06:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果還不知道\N發看將來人類的努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.08,1:06:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說 梅星上的植物\N也是你播種的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.50,1:06:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 我本來想把這個星球\N當作植物的樂園
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.75,1:06:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有了今天的成果
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.50,1:06:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這時候你們卻毀了\N這個星球的保護層闖了進來
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是小叮當在拍賣會上\N得到的安慰獎品
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.33,1:06:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道 其實是你念錯了號碼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.70,1:06:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會 這是最后一張
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.33,1:06:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法了 等一下我再想辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.41,1:06:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,SSS-BC-555
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.16,1:06:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  是333才對
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.87,1:07:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯,是333才對
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.54,1:07:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然會把3跟5搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.54,1:07:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.70,1:07:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過來的人還好是你們
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.87,1:07:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛開始的暴風雨\N是我借給植物們力量
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.16,1:07:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想藉機趕走你們
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.91,1:07:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那場暴風雨是你主使的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.50,1:07:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.08,1:07:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 救了我一命的這些花草\N也是你...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.54,1:07:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那是植物們的意識
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.00,1:07:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意識?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.37,1:07:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球的植物\N可以借行動表現出想法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.25,1:07:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表示這個星球上的植物\N愿意接受你們
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.25,1:07:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的使命也結束了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.16,1:07:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以放心的把這個星球\N交給愛護大自然的你們了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.50,1:07:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我們?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.00,1:07:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 到下一個星球去播種
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些壞人怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.25,1:07:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你們的力量去解決
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.70,1:07:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是一個鍛煉的機會
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.75,1:07:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.50,1:08:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心協力\N一定能夠克服的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.83,1:08:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.50,1:08:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.83,1:08:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那個黃金大怪物\N它從地面上飛了起來
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.83,1:08:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那馬上就會追到這里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.54,1:08:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 要怎么辦好啊?\N那馬上就會追到這里了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.70,1:08:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 要怎么辦好啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.54,1:08:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.66,1:08:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛過去了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.50,1:08:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來那家伙己經放棄\N所以便離開這個星球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.58,1:08:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.83,1:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么一來\N這個星球上己經沒有什么好怕的了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下那只藍色貓咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.91,1:08:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮當貓咪\N你已經想到回地面的方法了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.16,1:08:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是叮當貓咪 我叫小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.33,1:08:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我們也很想回去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.50,1:09:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.83,1:09:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是有啦 可是很危險
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.08,1:09:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么方法?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.04,1:09:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想辦法在火箭的后面產生爆作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.33,1:09:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這個沖擊力量\N火箭便會往前進
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.37,1:09:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來只要靠星球上的引力\N就能著陸了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.54,1:09:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 很簡單阿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.54,1:09:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要將這個太空站引爆就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.66,1:09:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是我的太空站啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.16,1:09:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.58,1:09:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是有定時炸藥嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 從工程現場偷來的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.50,1:09:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說偷 說“借”知道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.91,1:09:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 去準備吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.37,1:09:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.33,1:09:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 自己爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.83,1:09:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快點告訴大家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.50,1:10:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送我上去啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.70,1:10:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 謝謝你啊 葉子們
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去找他們再說
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.37,1:10:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 宜靜 阿福 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.04,1:10:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不遵守諾言
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.04,1:10:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾言?  我答應過你們什么嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大騙子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.41,1:10:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快給我松綁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.83,1:10:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 是社長的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.54,1:10:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄可能會來救你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.04,1:10:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么一來 那個星球就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.04,1:10:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,節省了很多時間跟力氣\N輕松的就把你們干掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.66,1:10:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 準備好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.83,1:10:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5分鐘后就會爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.33,1:10:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點到火箭上面去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝福你們了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.33,1:11:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.08,1:11:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 抓緊了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.83,1:11:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.16,1:11:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.83,1:11:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 讓他綁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.37,1:11:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繩子 繩子松掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.00,1:11:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 快點
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.50,1:11:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧黑痣先生的幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.50,1:11:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.91,1:11:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去制止它曝作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.37,1:11:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 別碰 很危險
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.83,1:11:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒時間了 快點到外面去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.66,1:11:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿透圈跟適應燈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.83,1:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了外面\N就馬上藏在其他的行星后面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.25,1:11:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.58,1:12:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當他 小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.70,1:12:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當他怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.04,1:12:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說要制止炸藥爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.37,1:12:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以還在里面沒出來
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.91,1:12:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會有事?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.70,1:12:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.50,1:12:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據森林里植物們的意見
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.25,1:12:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們希望能參加本星球的\N未來計劃委員會
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.33,1:12:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然歡迎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.25,1:12:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我們以前所住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.54,1:12:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為忽視植物們的意見\N而造成大洪水
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.00,1:12:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類似乎也開始注意到這一點了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.91,1:13:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 要定居在這個星球上\N就得刻不容緩的與植物們進行對話
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.16,1:13:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.08,1:13:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是火箭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.25,1:13:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么會這樣?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.08,1:13:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太過份了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.87,1:13:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛技術太差勁了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.33,1:13:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這應該是小叮當先生的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.58,1:13:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是差點把玩偶們嚇死
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.87,1:13:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去抗議吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.87,1:13:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當先生 這樣做太過份了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.91,1:13:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請把門打開
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.54,1:13:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是小叮當先生
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.25,1:13:41.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶...哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.33,1:13:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像安全降落了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.91,1:13:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有可愛的玩偶們來迎接\N實在太令人高興了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.00,1:13:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 我好餓
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.83,1:14:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里不是停放火箭的地點嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.54,1:14:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說 他們都到太空里去了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.66,1:14:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.16,1:14:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛到那么遠 我沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.20,1:14:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是宜靜的小象
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.70,1:14:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別嚇我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.33,1:14:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉? 你要背我啊 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.00,1:14:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是幫了我大忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.41,1:14:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經累壞了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.87,1:14:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能到鎮上去\N應該就會有辦法的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.83,1:14:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.25,1:14:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么鬼五郎的復制人\N會在那里監視四周呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.83,1:14:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄先生 是誰?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.00,1:15:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鎮上發生嚴重的事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.75,1:15:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 被占領?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.16,1:15:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然一架火箭從天而降
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.50,1:15:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球現在是我們的\N違抗者格殺勿論
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.54,1:15:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鎮上被弄得亂七八槽的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.75,1:15:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你獨自一只小豬\N居然也能逃了出來
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.08,1:15:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過到處都是他的手下\N我根本無法回去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.33,1:15:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當他們沒在火箭上嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.66,1:15:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.87,1:15:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有他在就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.00,1:15:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們到底上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.54,1:15:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.58,1:15:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生命發條
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.58,1:15:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是宜靜的玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.00,1:15:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是來把發條還給你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.25,1:15:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.16,1:15:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子不知道從哪里帶來的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.91,1:15:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道從哪帶來的?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.16,1:15:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你利用任意門回去地球上啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.20,1:15:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么說
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.58,1:16:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 備用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.83,1:16:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回地球一趟
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.33,1:16:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.16,1:16:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去太危險了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.66,1:16:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.75,1:16:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到處是那壞人的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.83,1:16:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子去比較好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.16,1:16:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它去的話不會被注意到
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.50,1:16:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,況且這種事它很在行的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.37,1:16:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.83,1:16:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好 是這種形狀的東西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.50,1:16:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門一打開就是我的房間
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.50,1:16:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把門后的衣柜打開
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.25,1:16:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只小豬跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.00,1:16:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.54,1:16:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能順利的拿來呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.16,1:16:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.70,1:17:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子們不知道怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.91,1:17:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長這樣做太過份了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.75,1:17:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦? 這里有那個東西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.75,1:17:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人懷念
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.41,1:17:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小時候一直好想坐的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.00,1:17:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以坐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.00,1:17:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.83,1:17:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.83,1:17:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.75,1:17:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袋子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.83,1:17:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猴子到底知不知道什么是衣柜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.91,1:17:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擔心 一定沒有問題的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.50,1:17:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有了那個口袋\N就能見到他們了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.83,1:17:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么見?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.33,1:18:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能平安回來真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.75,1:18:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那包袱里是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.66,1:18:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我的內褲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.50,1:18:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是帽子 雖然形狀都一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.08,1:18:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 備用袋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.20,1:18:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個袋子跟小叮當的口袋\N是相通的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.70,1:18:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要進到這里面...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.08,1:18:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一他們在宇宙里面 適應燈
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.04,1:18:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是以防萬一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.58,1:18:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 快點張開眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.37,1:18:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了我們該怎么辦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.16,1:18:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我們死在這種地方啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.66,1:18:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.58,1:18:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.75,1:19:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他醒了 小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.25,1:19:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然醒了 可是好像壞了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.00,1:19:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在我的口袋里面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.00,1:19:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.08,1:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.66,1:19:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.08,1:19:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.25,1:19:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.66,1:19:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還活著啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.04,1:19:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我們可以回到備用袋里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.75,1:19:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么不早點想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.87,1:19:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 快點回發條都市去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.70,1:19:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.33,1:19:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快跳到我的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.66,1:19:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 等待一下
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要亂摸 趕快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.54,1:19:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.00,1:19:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都回去了 再來就剩下我了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.75,1:19:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.37,1:20:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大家都沒事了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.04,1:20:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發條都市\N已經被鬼五郎他們給占領了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.83,1:20:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.87,1:20:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,個個都那么沒用
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.91,1:20:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎怎么會因為這樣就昏倒呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.16,1:20:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的看到骷髏骷顱頭
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.54,1:20:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊貓從后面打我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.20,1:20:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.33,1:20:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣你留在這里監視他們
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.00,1:20:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了嗎?  是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.00,1:20:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對不允許你們\N把這個星球上的木頭拿去賣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是蓋旅館飯店之類
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是這么認為
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.75,1:20:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.50,1:20:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把任意門拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.00,1:20:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么聲音
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.20,1:20:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是牛因斯坦跟羊迪生
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.04,1:20:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都沒事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們曾努力想保護家園\N但最終還是輸了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.33,1:21:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能想到的武器只有這個
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.25,1:21:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓我把他們打個落花流水吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安不可能的 他們都有手槍啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.58,1:21:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還好大家都沒事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.41,1:21:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他為了救我們\N自己又跑回去當誘餌
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.16,1:21:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果被他們給抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.70,1:21:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.33,1:21:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去救它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.83,1:21:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.75,1:21:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 有沒有什么好辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.33,1:21:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.04,1:21:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么辦法?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.25,1:21:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎以為我們死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.75,1:21:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要我們幫忙就請直說
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.00,1:21:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個計劃我們幾個人去就夠了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.00,1:21:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定把它救出來\N你們在這里等著
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.58,1:21:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石頭帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.83,1:22:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上這項帽子 就會類似隱形了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.16,1:22:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人會發現的 快戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.83,1:22:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這發明真是偉大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.16,1:22:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.66,1:22:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你旁邊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.91,1:22:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 照我們剛才說的\N馬上到市公所去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.87,1:22:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.66,1:22:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 我覺得還是\N把那些玩具給破壞掉比較好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.54,1:22:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 用用你的腦\N它們可以我們忙的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.16,1:22:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.41,1:22:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,況且又有了這扇門\N這里已經成了我們的天下了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.58,1:22:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是社長 腦子真聰明
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.41,1:22:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們打算怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.00,1:22:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.25,1:22:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當他們\N一定不會允許你們這么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.58,1:23:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們 他們真是可憐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.83,1:23:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.33,1:23:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.91,1:23:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死掉了?  你騙我的吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.83,1:23:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是實話 大雄掉到大斷層下面
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他四個人...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.66,1:23:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜小姐呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.91,1:23:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停電啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.25,1:23:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有人關掉開關吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.20,1:23:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.54,1:23:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是寂寞 居然丟下我們不管
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.54,1:23:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.00,1:23:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的錯 是社長啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.33,1:23:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滾吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.66,1:23:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們果然還活著
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.41,1:23:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 我們來救你了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.25,1:23:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.66,1:23:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 有鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.41,1:23:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩的幽靈出現了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.54,1:23:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?  世界上哪里有幽靈
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.16,1:24:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道他們活著回來了\N快點抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.41,1:24:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 他好像發現了\N我們快點逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.20,1:24:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.33,1:24:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烏云瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.33,1:24:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要躲進這個烏云里\N就會變成隱身
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.58,1:24:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓敵人看不到我們
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.25,1:24:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要噴了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.50,1:24:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我進來了\N- 眼睛好難過啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.16,1:24:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起跟著烏云跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.00,1:24:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 小豬被救走了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.87,1:24:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 有個鎖頭在跑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.08,1:24:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.70,1:24:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們一定又用了什么道具
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點鎖定鎖頭為目標
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.50,1:24:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點逃到森林里
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.54,1:24:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 烏云散掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.83,1:24:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終于露出你們的真面目了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.75,1:24:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點抓住他們 別讓他們跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.50,1:25:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.33,1:25:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到這里就突然不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.37,1:25:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還沒跑遠
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.66,1:25:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家分頭仔細給我找是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.50,1:25:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮當貓 快點出來 你們跑不掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.58,1:25:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有跟他們拼一拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.87,1:25:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 你沒有武器嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.08,1:25:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在樹林里面 是不能用空氣槍的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.16,1:25:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飄飄槍
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.83,1:25:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是夢想魔幻樂園的那支槍嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.16,1:25:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是贈送的紀念品
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.66,1:25:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是槍嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.16,1:25:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.50,1:25:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.70,1:25:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.83,1:25:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們跑了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.00,1:25:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.66,1:25:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開槍打它
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.54,1:26:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子彈沒有了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.50,1:26:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.75,1:26:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.33,1:26:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們要跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.83,1:26:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.04,1:26:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.25,1:26:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體突然浮了起來
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.04,1:26:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.83,1:26:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯啊 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.70,1:26:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 我的射擊技術不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.41,1:26:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.08,1:26:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點抬著他們兩個\N通通逃到森林里面去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.50,1:26:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們給我記住
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.16,1:26:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.83,1:26:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.87,1:26:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小恐龍 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.66,1:26:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你特地來救我們啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.66,1:26:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小恐龍真厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.75,1:26:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是技安的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.54,1:26:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫玩偶們一起回鎮上去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.58,1:26:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.66,1:27:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.58,1:27:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為小叮當他們的幫忙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.75,1:27:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們又重新奪回發條都市
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.00,1:27:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但并不表示從此就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.41,1:27:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他們遠躲在森林里\N我們不能只是逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.16,1:27:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我們同心協力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.66,1:27:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算武器很小也要跟他們打
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.91,1:27:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須用自己的雙手\N來保護這個星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.66,1:27:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定 要堅持到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.33,1:27:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播種使者在離開的時候也曾說過
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.25,1:27:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠你們的力量來解決\N這點你應該知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰是播種使者?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.66,1:27:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我掉到大斷層時 所遇到的神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.20,1:27:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神仙?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.66,1:27:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是個閃耀金黃色光芒的少年
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.87,1:27:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他不停變幻外形\N時而變成大魔神
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.75,1:27:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來他是個神仙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.00,1:27:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫做播種使者啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.41,1:28:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他說他曾經在火星跟地球上\N播下了生命的種子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.08,1:28:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但火星因為小行星的撞擊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.70,1:28:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而沒有生命延續
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.25,1:28:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個事情我聽說過
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.50,1:28:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從火星落到地球上的隕石\N據說有生命的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.70,1:28:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,播種使者在這個星球上\N播下了種子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.04,1:28:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來來如此啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也有責任保衛這個星球
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.16,1:28:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 你說的對
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.16,1:28:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們要抓住鬼五郎\N把他帶回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.66,1:28:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 小猴子有情報匯報
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.25,1:28:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎他們明天一早\N就要進行總攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.16,1:28:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們今晚好好休息\N明天準備應戰
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.25,1:28:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.33,1:28:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.66,1:28:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.66,1:28:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要先吃點東西啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.50,1:28:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.16,1:29:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道鬼五郎他們會從哪里攻進來
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.91,1:29:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要顧好自己的崗位
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.08,1:29:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄這一班負責蛋蛋屋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.25,1:29:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 阿福這一班負責商店街
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.25,1:29:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆這一班負責中央
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.16,1:29:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有任何狀況都要馬上通知我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.00,1:29:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.20,1:29:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.16,1:29:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然對手是小孩跟玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.00,1:29:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但絕對不能再饒過他們了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.66,1:29:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個個的把他們解決掉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.50,1:29:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何活口也不準留
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.20,1:29:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.04,1:30:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了 他們兵分多路
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.04,1:30:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安和阿福 你那有4個人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.66,1:30:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 好像有4個人\N往我們這邊來了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.20,1:30:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,4個人啊 絕不能放過他們
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.00,1:30:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家上
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.70,1:30:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來躲在這里啊 這些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.16,1:30:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是骷髏 教命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.66,1:30:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位加油
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.66,1:30:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎 看招 抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.20,1:30:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.00,1:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你那里也有4個
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.66,1:30:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.83,1:30:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.04,1:30:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被發現了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.83,1:30:50.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.33,1:30:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把槍給我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.33,1:31:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正面有5個人 皮姆我們準備上了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.58,1:31:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家沖啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.33,1:31:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社長 他們人那么多\N我們打不贏的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.33,1:31:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰說的 快點把他們給殺了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.04,1:31:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生 你怎么也在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.25,1:31:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么辦法\N我也是鬼五郎的分身啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.16,1:31:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳 一個個都沒用 用最后一招
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.08,1:31:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.75,1:31:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 森林著火了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.91,1:32:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么這么過份
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.83,1:32:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮當貓咪 如果你不想讓火勢越大
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.66,1:32:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就馬上向我投降
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.87,1:32:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 想想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.70,1:32:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去森林跟鎮上\N都會化為灰燼的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.70,1:32:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 放大燈
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.33,1:32:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.58,1:32:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.00,1:32:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槽糕 鬼五郎逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.33,1:32:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去追\N- 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.50,1:32:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.87,1:33:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小木馬 小木馬
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.87,1:33:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎往哪里...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.20,1:33:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他往這里啊 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.83,1:33:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到他們\N比我想像的要難對付
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.70,1:33:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.04,1:33:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.16,1:33:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.58,1:33:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起來
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.20,1:33:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼 出來跟我一決勝負吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.00,1:33:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起來也沒用
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.70,1:33:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.16,1:33:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.83,1:33:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個小鬼到底躲在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.58,1:33:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林里的植物們 挺身出來救我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.00,1:33:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼五郎
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.16,1:33:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.50,1:34:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.83,1:34:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕 救我啊\N我不會再做壞事了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.04,1:34:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你真是神槍手
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.50,1:34:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有的事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.54,1:34:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在感謝各位
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.37,1:34:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這些復制人\N又不能帶回地球上去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.50,1:34:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要用復制蛋清理器\N把他們都清理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.75,1:34:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該只剩下一個人而已
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.87,1:35:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得自己好像重新活過來
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.00,1:35:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給大家添了麻煩 對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.50,1:35:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你變成本體啦
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.25,1:35:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去地球上自首
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.54,1:35:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑痣先生
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.50,1:35:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意門
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.37,1:35:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 保重了 再見
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.41,1:35:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下來要幫助發條都市恢復原狀
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.91,1:35:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這個星球就交給皮姆它們\N這樣比較好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.33,1:35:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們偶爾來找你們玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.50,1:35:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.50,1:35:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮姆 波比 你們要加油哦\N我們會常來找你們玩
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.54,1:35:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜小姐 保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.70,1:35:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龍老弟 哥哥會在遙遠的地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.87,1:35:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈求你永遠幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.66,1:35:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你未免太夸張了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.25,1:36:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木馬 好好保重
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.37,1:36:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.83,1:36:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會再來的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.87,1:36:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.20,1:36:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會再來找你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.20,1:36:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.10,1:36:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有愛就夠了\N愛だけあればいい
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.10,1:36:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是 為你\Nすべては　For you
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.00,1:36:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕩漾在心中的思念\Nれるこの想い
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.00,1:36:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法抑止的愛\Nたまらなく　いとしくて
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.34,1:36:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦... 愛就是你\NLaLaLa... Love is you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.61,1:37:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上的風　也回應著我\N街は風の中　答えも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.75,1:37:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那風中\NIn the wind
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.87,1:37:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使再沉重的悲哀\Nどんな悲しみも
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.87,1:37:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要關上心扉擋住\Nくい止めよう　心の手前で
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.30,1:37:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這淚水與笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.50,1:37:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N繰り返すこの都?（まち）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.71,1:38:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都忘掉吧　就在此刻\Nすべてを忘れて　今は
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.77,1:38:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的我只想緊緊抱住你\N抱きしめたい
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.37,1:38:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛就是你\NLove is you
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這淚水與笑容\Nと微笑みを
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.00,1:38:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一再上演的都市中\N繰り返すこの都?（まち）
